%% MUPP-082 Christmas Eve card by number of kids
%% The layout of the Christmas Eve card follows the number of kids on it.
flowchart TD
    A[Visitor reaches the Christmas Eve card] --> B{How many kids?}
    B -- 1 --> C[Single card, R1]
    B -- 2 --> D[Like the twin card, no age, R2]
    B -- 3 --> E[Three wide rows, R3]
    B -- 4 or more --> F[Small tiles, two by two, R4]
    E --> G[Press a row or tile]
    F --> G
    D --> H[Press the wish button]
    G --> I[The kid opens with the list unfolded]
    H --> I
    C --> I
